config VIDEO_RPI_IMX290
	tristate "Sony IMX290/IMX327 sensor support (Raspberry Pi driver)"
	depends on I2C && VIDEO_DEV
	depends on MEDIA_CAMERA_SUPPORT
	select MEDIA_CONTROLLER
	select VIDEO_V4L2_SUBDEV_API
	select V4L2_FWNODE
	select REGMAP_I2C
	help
	  The Sony IMX290/IMX327 driver from Raspberry Pi's kernel (2 or 4
	  MIPI CSI-2 lanes, 1920x1080 and 1280x720, colour and mono IMX290),
	  with the bus configuration, frame interval and Rockchip module
	  information the Rockchip CSI-2 D-PHY and ISP drivers need.

	  The module is called rpi_imx290.

